<p>Which nitrogen atom in the neurotransmitter serotonin is expected to be the most basic. Please explain your answer.</p>

<p class="mt-align-center"><img alt="clipboard_e09d6a7acfc8af13b5a7c09cfb9a0e484.png" style="width: 266px; height: 225px;" width="266px" height="225px" class="internal" loading="lazy" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/353109/clipboard_e09d6a7acfc8af13b5a7c09cfb9a0e484.png?revision=1&amp;size=bestfit&amp;width=266&amp;height=225" /></p>

